	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Soli deo honor.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/><placeName ref="l491">Argentinae</placeName> 28. Ianuarii 1549.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>S. P.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Non possum satis admirari, <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> amice et <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>domine charissime, quorundam vestratium negligentiam, ne dicam <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>an exosam segnitiam, qui in literis dandis adeo sunt negligen<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>tes.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Dedi filio senis <persName ref="p344">Binderi</persName> ad familiarem amicum <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>meum <persName ref="p1560">Ioannem Hoperum</persName> literas: dedi item alias alicui manco <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>manu altera civi vestro, arte, ni fallor, vietor antehac, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>qui jam hic pepla divendidit, ad eundem <persName ref="p1560">Hoperum</persName>; in quibu<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>s, quod otium non erat, inclusi literas <placeName ref="l830">Anglicas</placeName> illinc mi<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>hi missas, quas volui ut tecum communicaret.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Hinc item <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ante dies sex <placeName ref="l28">Basileam</placeName> versus scripsi literas ad civem <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>quendam <persName ref="p20430">Valentinum Nußboum</persName>, quibuscum adjunxi meas <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ad tuam humanitatem scriptas, quas rogavi serio ut ad <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>te tuto transmitteret.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Adjunxi item <placeName ref="l830">Anglicas</placeName> tuis, quas <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>tibi interpretandas commisi D. <persName ref="p1560">Hopero</persName>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Si harum nulla <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ad vos pervenerit, infortunium erit, quod vindicabo prae<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>sentibus: nam breviter attingam quaecunque illic contenta <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>sunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Atque principio literae <placeName ref="l830">Anglica</placeName> nostra scriptae, atque per <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>mancum missae, haec continent.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">rex noster ad mensem Se<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>ptembrem vel Octobrem praeparatis aliquot navibus in <placeName ref="l2524">Scotiam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>misit, ut alimentum deferrent operariis et militibus, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>qui castrum aliquod moliti sunt aedificare in praesidium portus <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>alicujus (quod vi nacti sint) ad hostes ab introitu a<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>rcendos.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Milities et nautae posteaquam eo pervenerant, egressi <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>navibus civitatem aliquam proxime adjacentem conati <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>sunt expugnare, Dobar nomine.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Primo tamen impetu, <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>cum de fuga cogitarent, ducum fortitudine revocati sunt; <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>caesi enimm sunt ad triginta nostratium, id quod fugam peperit.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Secundo igitur experti Martis aleam; dux civitatis inter<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>fectus est, caeterique tum cives tum milites fugam dederunt re<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>licta civitate vacua.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Itaque nostri ea potiti sunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Verum <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>quum eam non satis munitam cernerent, et <placeName ref="l2524">Scotorum</placeName> justum <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>exercitum adesse sequenti die explorassent, accepta spolia, <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>moenia subverterunt civitatemque incenderunt, proh dolor!</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Re itaque foeliciter gesta ad naves cum magna tum auri, <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>argenti, et supellectilis copia, tum maximo jumentorum, <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>ovium, equorumque grege, ad suos reliquos et naves reversi <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>sunt incolumes.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Hac clade accepta <placeName ref="l2524">Scoti</placeName> legatis missis, <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>ut creditur, coeperunt de pace agere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Atque haec continebant <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>primae: secundae de rebus religionis, qualiter triduo <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>disputatum sit a quatuor episcopis; nempe <placeName ref="l1255">Cantuariensis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>et alterius doctor Pfarher nominatus a parte evangelii, et <placeName ref="l567">Wur<lb xml:id="p1z44"/>cestrensis</placeName> et <placeName ref="l2612">Westmonasteriensis</placeName> a parte papistarum.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Nichilt <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>tamen dum constitutum est, neque concionatur publice.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Caeterum quoniam spero te easdem accepturas, praetereo caetera.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Verum hoc unum et vere prudens juvenis nostri regis ad pro<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>tectorem responsum non praetereundum duxi.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Disputatione <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>peracta accessit protector mirabundus regem, inquiens; "Episco<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>pus <placeName ref="l2612">Westmonasteriensis</placeName> quam fefellit expectationem meam!"</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">"<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>Tuam," inquit, "potuit fefellisse, at meam nunquam."</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Quum <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>protector causam investigaret diligentius, "Nunquam aliud," in<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>quit rex, "ab eo sperabam, quam ut Interim oleret, qui <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>tam diu apud Caesarem legatum egit, idque hoc saeculo."</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z11"/>Dignum certe iuveni rege responsum, quod tacendum non <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>putabam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Caeterum ut <persName ref="p1548">Richardum</persName> veniam, is orat, ut <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>suam cunctationem boni consules, per otium scripturus.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Negotia <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>impediebant adhuc et a <placeName ref="l296">Londino</placeName> absentia.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Nam primo <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>statim ingressu non ausus erat eo venire cum uxo<lb xml:id="p2z16"/>re et liberis propter pestem, quae maxime saeviebat ist<lb xml:id="p2z17"/>hic, et iam in disponendis aedibus totus est.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">D. <persName ref="p1560">Ho<lb xml:id="p2z18"/>pero</persName> et <persName ref="p506">Butlero</persName> rogo ut quam diligentissime me commendatum <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>habeas.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l491">Argentina</placeName> nostr hucusque manet ut antehac.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Dom<lb xml:id="p2z20"/>inus concedat, ut diuturnum et perpetuum fiat!</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8041">Ioannes <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>a Lasco</persName> fuit in <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName>; neque discessisse nec obiisse mortem <lb xml:id="p2z22"/>a meis quicquam accepi, quod omnino non tacuisset <lb xml:id="p2z23"/><persName ref="p1548">Richardus</persName>.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la"><persName>Gabriell</persName> coriarius item nihil simile au<lb xml:id="p2z24"/>divisse se narrat.</s>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z25"/>Tu<lb xml:id="p2z27"/>u<lb xml:id="p2z29"/>s <persName ref="p505">I[o<lb xml:id="p2z30"/>an<lb xml:id="p2z31"/>n<lb xml:id="p2z32"/>es] <lb xml:id="p2z36"/>B<lb xml:id="p2z38"/>[<lb xml:id="p2z41"/>u<lb xml:id="p2z42"/>r<lb xml:id="p2z43"/>che<lb xml:id="p2z44"/>ru<lb xml:id="p2z45"/>s</persName>].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Dem ffürnemmen, wisen <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>hern <persName ref="p495">Heinrich Bullinger</persName>, <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>predicanten, wonhaft by <lb xml:id="p4z4"/>dem Münster.</s>
					<s n="37" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p4z5"/><placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName>.</s>
